#: ../../05-data-and-api.md:35 e9086418cd764aef9e497a3596cd149d
msgid "05. Data and API"
msgstr "05. 数据与 API"

#: ../../05-data-and-api.md:39 15f6d019dc224d1c8efe358c36ff4276
msgid ""
"This page covers the API and data contracts of OpenResty/ngx_lua as used "
"from Lua. It is not an exhaustive reference (see [08-lua-nginx-"
"module](08-lua-nginx-module.md) for every directive and API); here we "
"capture the contracts that most application code depends on, including the "
"DNS-resolution error contract as a worked example."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍从 Lua 使用 OpenResty/ngx_lua 时的 API 与数据契约。它不是详尽参考（每个指令和 API 见 [08-lua-"
"nginx-module](08-lua-nginx-module.md)）；这里记录的是大多数应用代码所依赖的契约，其中把 DNS "
"解析错误契约作为一个完整的示例。"

#: ../../05-data-and-api.md:45 6d4dcec69c784416a4ba135701f22065
msgid "The Nginx API for Lua"
msgstr "Nginx API for Lua"

#: ../../05-data-and-api.md:47 3e20b4e5979040259e5f0c38ed2eb507
msgid ""
"Lua code in OpenResty talks to Nginx through the `ngx.*` API - a coroutine "
"context is created per request and the API exposes request state, output, "
"and subsystems."
msgstr ""
"在 OpenResty 中，Lua 代码通过 `ngx.*` API 与 Nginx 交互——每个请求都会创建一个协程上下文，API "
"暴露请求状态、输出和各子系统。"

